Needs: none.

Grounding test command: ssh into the app server and run:
cd ~/uncle && node words/grounding-test.js --count 200 --batch 5
It tests both the model (at MODEL_URL) and Gemini head to head, outputs per-reply results to words/grounding-results.json. Point MODEL_URL at your new model's vLLM endpoint to test it.

--
Needs: @personalisaacw render the chart messages in xr/ as floating panels per CONTRACTS.md and PLAN.md Part 3.

Chart message format (CONTRACTS.md): { type: 'chart', chart: { kind: 'line|bar|range', title: '...', labels: ['...'], datasets: [{ label: '...', data: [0] }] } }

Three chart types sent:
- line: savings trajectory (labels are ages, data is dollar amounts)
- range: life expectancy (low/median/high for life expectancy and healthy years)
- bar: before/after a slider change (current path vs with the change)

